  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Don't Get 2 Close To My Fantasy**: back after 67 archived shows (1106 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Buenos Tardes, Amigos**: back after 197 archived shows (2399 days); rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Band leaves stage- lots of folks leave the venue!**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **I'll Be Your Jonny On Th' Spot**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Young At Heart Jam w/Deaner On Drums**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2007-10-25** (recommended): source not stated; 36 songs; 173 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording has distortion and clipping; the built-in mics handle loud bursts and sudden volume changes poorly, though still listenable [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The venue PA had problems all night; crowd was the usual drunk, rowdy Ween audience [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2007-10-25**: taped by Toad; source: Zoom H2 [1]. Also: Recorded with a Zoom H2, then CD Wave, Traders Little Helper (FLAC 8), and Easy Tag; no other taper seen [1]",
